---
import WikiLayout from '../layouts/WikiLayout.astro';
---

<WikiLayout title="Mod Changelog" description="Update history and patch notes for Idle Guild Master Modded.">
  <div class="pageHeader">
    <h1>Mod Changelog</h1>
    <p>Version history, balance adjustments, new class masteries, and systems overhaul.</p>
  </div>

  <article class="changelogEntry">
    <div class="entryHeader">
      <h2>v1.2.0 — Doctrine & Class Rebalance</h2>
      <span class="dateBadge">Latest Release</span>
    </div>
    <div class="entryBody">
      <h3>Adventurers & Classes</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Added complete Tier 9 masteries for Footman, Apprentice, Archer, Rogue, and Outlander lines.</li>
        <li><strong>Aether Mage Line:</strong> Introduced Aether Mage, Aether Archmage, Disintegrator, Grand Magus, and Singularity Magus with resonance scaling.</li>
        <li><strong>Angel of War:</strong> Updated aura scaling and multi-target retribution defensive mechanics.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Combat & Balance</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Overhauled defense damage reduction curves with consistent diminishing returns.</li>
        <li>Normalized attack speed formulas and status effect tick rates.</li>
        <li>Added rare drop indicators and unique items for high-tier expeditions.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</WikiLayout>

<style>
.pageHeader {
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.changelogEntry {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.entryHeader {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

.entryHeader h2 {
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  margin: 0;
  border: none;
  padding: 0;
}

.dateBadge {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.15);
  color: #4ade80;
}

.entryBody h3 {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  color: var(--text-gold);
  margin-top: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.entryBody ul {
  padding-left: 1.25rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
}

.entryBody li {
  margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
}
</style>
